/**
 * The Middleman. No print was issued: the page was written on 27 Oct 2026
 * from an eight-slide research deck that carried no sources at all, and every
 * figure on it was sourced from scratch by six researchers, each followed by a
 * skeptic who re-opened every source (CLAUDE.md, Findings 0j). The deck's
 * numbers were mostly real ones detached from their scope, date or
 * definition, so this page keeps three registers: Filed (an SEC filing, a
 * statute or a regulator's own release, and the default), Reported (a named
 * outlet, read where it opened) and Estimate (someone's model, named).
 *
 * The title and lede are the builder's working text and the owner's to change.
 * Anthropic appears in section 08 as one of three buyers at the top of the
 * chain; its figures are read from its own S-1, set out exactly as the other
 * two companies' are, and no characterisation of it is the builder's.
 */
