        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>

    <Section n="11" title="Sources" id="sources">
      <p class="c-full mono">Read on 27 October 2026, each by one reader and again by a second who tried to overturn it</p>
      <p class="c-full mono">Not routed around where they refused this sandbox: the Financial Times, CNBC, Bloomberg, Business Insider and Forbes, read where a named relay opened; the Federal Register and eCFR pages, read through govinfo and the Legal Information Institute</p>
